kENT3l-pAyEg1AKedQ2lGw
=E2=80=9CTriple Espresso=E2=80=9D
compadres Mallory Swanson and Wilson) are the presumed stars of the NWSL. R=
odman, alongside Wilson (who clocked the Michael Jordan =E2=80=9Cshrug=E2=
=80=9D celebration after scoring in the 2022 Championship final) have not j=
ust the skill but the personality flourishes reminiscent of Alex Morgan sip=
ping the tea in Lyon.

The NWSL has yet to replicate the Morgan effect (think default attendance r=
ecords and adoring away fans), but requiring that teams reward players with=
 a certain
je ne sais quoi
in their international football fame was baked into the league=E2=80=99s or=
iginal attempt at the HIP criteria.

