<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;"><strong>By Jeff Rueter</strong></p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Before this weekend, the last time Folarin=
 Balogun scored was in the United States=E2=80=99 2-0 win over Bosnia and H=
erzegovina at this summer=E2=80=99s World Cup.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">The ensuing four months have seldom seen B=
alogun=E2=80=99s playing ability discussed. His breakout World Cup was over=
shadowed entirely <a href=3D"https://ablink.editorial.theguardian.com/ss/c/=
u001.Yw_JkLMEmFuifc_XG18IRyTNtZQ7fIEMgszcCSneHEBgtjhYSJYcaNsDra0BxnPgRLd8uB=
